      "widgets_values": [
        "DiT360 / FLUX - Circular Padding (KSampler + VAE Decode)\\n\\nGoal: reduce seam by padding the latent during sampling + padding during VAE decode.\\n\\nWhat to change:\\n- UNETLoader: choose full FLUX dev if possible (fp8 can be less stable).\\n- Circular padding values: start at 16; try 8/24/32 depending on seam vs quality.\\n- EdgeBlender.blend_width: 10-40 (larger hides seam more, but can blur).\\n\\nIf output quality drops:\\n- Reduce circular_padding first (16 -> 8).\\n- Keep RoPE OFF in this workflow."
      ],
      "color": "#263",
      "bgcolor": "#385"
    },
